    "directions": [
      "In a handi or kadai, add mustard oil, once it's smoky hot, add bay leaf, green cardamom, black cardamom, cumin seeds and let it splutter well.",
      "Add onions and cook it well until translucent.",
      "Add prepared curd mixture, green chillies, tender coriander stems, salt to taste and cook it for 5-6 minutes on medium flames.",
      "Add paneer, water, tomatoes and let it simmer for a while.",
      "Finish it with jaggery and mix well.",
      "Transfer it to a serving dish and garnish it with coriander sprig.",
      "Serve hot with roti or naan.",
      "In a bowl, add curd, ginger garlic paste, degi red chili powder, turmeric powder, coriander powder, cumin powder and give it a good mix.",
      "Keep it aside for further use."
    ],
